                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a pretty short game, only requiring an hour or two to complete. It is mostly reading with a bit of point and click. There is a minesweeper like puzzle game hidden in it. Pay attention to what is on your computer screen. It is less of a game and more of an interactive story about what morticians do. I mostly liked it. That said, I'm not sure I would buy it. I got it as part of a humble bundle. If you like short, cozy games or the macabre, then this is a good choice.",
